step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Speak to <col=800000>King Shareen</col> in the <col=800000>Grand Tree</col> with two empty slots to receive a <col=800000>translation book</col> and a <col=800000>bark sample</col>.</col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>Speak to King Shareen in the Grand Tree with two empty slots to receive a translation book and a bark sample.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>Hazelmere</col> in his house on the island east of <col=800000>Yanille</col> (<col=800000>fairy ring</col> code: CLS). He will take your bark sample and give you a <col=800000>message</col> for the king.</col>
step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>Speak to King Shareen in the Grand Tree with two empty slots to receive a translation book and a bark sample.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Hazelmere in his house on the island east of Yanille (fairy ring code: CLS). He will take your bark sample and give you a message for the king.</str>
