step	6	-	Quick guide step 6
line	<str>Speak to King Shareen in the Grand Tree with two empty slots to receive a translation book and a bark sample.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Hazelmere in his house on the island east of Yanille (fairy ring code: CLS). He will take your bark sample and give you a message for the king.</str>
line	
